      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 20 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Enhanced Southwest Monsoon (Habagat)\nIssued at: 2:00 AM, 20 July 2025(Sunday)\n\nORANGE WARNING LEVEL: Metro Manila, Rizal, Bataan, Bulacan, Zambales and Pampanga.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING is still THREATENING.\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Cavite, Batangas, Laguna, Quezon and Tarlac.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, light to moderate with occasional heavy rains affecting Nueva Ecija which may persist within 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 5:00 AM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
