      "text": "[7:46PM] #Ojo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAgbara Customs Checkpoint to Federal Road Safety Corps Office, Ijanikin is good movement, allowing for a smooth journey.\n\nTipper Garage to Iyana Era is moving, but not as smooth as other areas.\n\nIyana Era to Afromedia is steady, with traffic flowing well.\n\nAfromedia to Iyana Iba is better movement inward Volks, with a smooth ride ascending the Iyana Iba flyover towards Mile 2.\n\nUnderneath the flyover, Igando-bound traffic is okay, with no major congestion reported.\n\nVolks to Abule Osun and Trade Fair to Abule Ado is a seamless movement, making these routes good to take.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
