      "text": "[8:20PM] #LagosIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood Vehicular movement from Adekunle intersection on 3rd Mainland Bridge inward Adeniji Adele Road, down to Obalende Bridge.\nInward Onikan descending Flag House enroute CMS Bridge down to UBA connecting Apongbon is good.\n\nApongbon Bridge descending to Outer Marina inward CMS to train station is good.\n\nNitel junction to State House inward McWen Bridge by Officers Mess down to Bonny Camp is good movement \n\nAscending Obalende Bridge inward Dolphin intersection down to Carter Bridge exit to link back to 3rd Mainland Bridge inward Iyana-Oworo is also good movement. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
